   old = HEAD c36e076 built from git archive; new = working tree. Prompt 512x32 on CUDA, 256x32 / 128x16 on CPU.
     4B Q8 CUDA     prefill 130.7 -> 132.3 (+1.2%)  decode 32.07 -> 31.99 (-0.2%)
     2B BF16 CUDA   328.9 -> 329.0 (+0.1%)           46.67 -> 46.31 (-0.8%)
     1.7B BF16 CUDA 1433.9 -> 1440.0 (+0.4%)         45.03 -> 44.83 (-0.4%)
     Granite CUDA   345.8 -> 345.2 (-0.2%)           152.59 -> 153.32 (+0.5%)
